    values:partOf concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-195az ;
    skos:note "Court discretion to consider factors when granting relief for moral rights infringement Damages recovered in one proceeding are taken into account in assessing damages in another proceeding arising out of the same operation or transaction. Decision of a court is final. Presumption of authorship for film director, producer or screenwriter" ;
